body:
@Haroenv in `urlSync`, the configuration could be as follow:
```
mapping: {
  q: 'search',
  fR: 'features',
  dFR: 'choices',
}
```
but this is still an issue for nested values like the `dFR` one: `[url]?dFR[choice_features.Power supply][0]=Battery&dFR[choice_features.Brand][0]=Samsung`

So I was thinking similar but more nested, like:
```
mapping: {
  q: 'search',
  fR: 'features',
  dFR: {
    choice_features: {
      'Brand': 'brand',
      'Power supply': 'power-supply',
    },
  }
}
```

which would give: `[url]?power-supply=Battery&brand=Samsung`.

Is there an ETA for this PoC? If not, is this possible to customize the url and title in [vue instantseach](https://github.com/algolia/vue-instantsearch)? (the only alternative I'm willing to give a shot).
